<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Daesitiates</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Daesitiates were an Illyrian people of central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bosnia">Bosnia</a>, in the hills around the upper Bosna valley. Under their leader Bato they began the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/great-illyrian-revolt">Great Illyrian Revolt</a> against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> in 6 CE, joined by the Pannonian Breuci, and held out until 9 CE. After their defeat they were organised as a community of the Roman province of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dalmatia">Dalmatia</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/daesitiates.jpg" alt="Daesitiates" width="278" height="480" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: LeonDardan · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ilirski_bojevnik_-_Bato.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
